    "intro_narrative": "Welcome, brave seeker, to the Sanctum of the Forgotten Mage. For centuries, this mystical tower has been sealed away from the mortal realm, guarding a secret of unimaginable power. Legends speak of a hidden artifact deep within these walls, capable of granting supreme wisdom to whoever possesses it. As you step through the grand archway, the air hums with residual magical energy. Glowing runes line the stone walls, and strange arcane devices lie dormant, waiting for a master's touch. Your objective is clear: navigate this labyrinth of enchantments, activate the magical relics in the correct sequence, and claim the ultimate prize hidden within. But tread carefully, for the magic here is wild and deeply interconnected. The Sanctum tests not just your courage, but your wit and understanding of the arcane arts. You must decipher the ancient connections to unravel the mysteries. Will you unlock the secrets of the ancients, or become another lost soul wandering the tower?",
    "narrative_style": "fantasy"
  },
